<article class="env-remark" id="09CY">
  <p><a class="environment-identifier" href="/tag/09CY">Remark <span data-tag="09CY">21.38.6</span>.</a> Assumptions and notation as in Situation <a href="/tag/08P8" data-tag="08P8">21.38.1</a>. Note that setting $\mathcal{C}' = \mathcal{D}$ and $u$ equal to the structure functor of $\mathcal{C}$ gives a situation as in Situation <a href="/tag/08PA" data-tag="08PA">21.38.3</a>. Hence Lemma <a href="/tag/08PC" data-tag="08PC">21.38.5</a> tells us we have functors $\pi _!$, $\pi _!^{\textit{Ab}}$, $L\pi _!$, and $L\pi _!^{\textit{Ab}}$ such that $forget \circ \pi _! = \pi _!^{\textit{Ab}} \circ forget$ and $forget \circ L\pi _! = L\pi _!^{\textit{Ab}} \circ forget$. </p>
</article>